- **Session management & auditing** – Implemented persistent session visibility with the new `SessionLogEntry.java:16-86` entity, `SessionLogRepository.java:19-42` finders, and an overhauled `SessionManagementResource.java:43-325` that lists real sessions, revokes individual/all sessions, reports suspicious activity, and records everything with the generalized `AuditLogService.recordSecurityAction(...)` helper (`AuditLogService.java:95-122`). `ImpersonationSessionRepository.java:118-138` now exposes `findActiveByTargetEmail` to back the UI/REST workflow.
- **Frontend/spec alignment** – `AccountSecurityView.vue:310-344` always hydrates the latest export status so completed jobs display download links, and open-api specs (`modules/core-platform/api/v1/openapi.yaml:5177-5224` plus the JSON sibling) describe the new `/api/v1/privacy/*` endpoints so SDKs stay in sync.
